sequenceDiagram
    participant Config
    participant Runtime
    participant SQLite
    participant Collector
    Config->>Runtime: Apply candidate (hash/revision)
    Runtime->>SQLite: Persist journal under lifecycle lock
    Runtime->>Collector: Native config validate
    alt Validation/activation succeeds
      Runtime->>Collector: Activate and supervise
      Collector-->>Runtime: Ready evidence
      Runtime->>SQLite: Commit Applied generation
    else Failure or interrupted activation
      Runtime->>SQLite: Read LKG and journal
      Runtime->>Collector: Restore/restart LKG
      Runtime->>SQLite: Commit failure/recovery evidence
    end
    Note over Runtime: Ready != OTLP delivered
